WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.659
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.659 --> 00:00:06.986
Everyone is talking at once, and Maya cannot write it all down!

3
00:00:07.986 --> 00:00:11.532
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:12.532 --> 00:00:15.080
This is Episode 91.

5
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.154
Meet the writing quill.

6
00:00:19.154 --> 00:00:22.482
Say something, and the quill writes it down.

7
00:00:23.482 --> 00:00:27.668
The orbs talk fast, and the quill keeps up with every word.

8
00:00:28.668 --> 00:00:31.114
Two talking at the same time?

9
00:00:32.114 --> 00:00:35.967
The quill writes two cards, and knows who said what.

10
00:00:36.967 --> 00:00:41.423
Now Maya can read it all later, as many times as she wants.

11
00:00:42.423 --> 00:00:44.920
That is Amazon Transcribe.

12
00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:49.491
It listens to talking and turns it into written words.

13
00:00:50.491 --> 00:00:52.808
Now you know the writing quill!

14
00:00:53.808 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

